flowchart TD
    A[main] --> B[Read CSV loan dataset]
    B --> C[Split into X and y<br/>target = default]
    C --> D[Detect numeric and categorical columns]

    D --> E[Build numeric preprocessing pipeline]
    E --> F[Median imputation]
    F --> G[StandardScaler]

    D --> H[Build categorical preprocessing pipeline]
    H --> I[Most-frequent imputation]
    I --> J[OneHotEncoder]

    G --> K[ColumnTransformer preprocess]
    J --> K

    K --> L[train_test_split stratified]
    L --> M[Train baseline LogisticRegression pipeline]
    M --> N[Predict probabilities baseline]
    N --> O[Compute baseline ROC AUC]

    O --> P[Configure RandomForestClassifier]
    P --> Q[Wrap with CalibratedClassifierCV isotonic]
    Q --> R[Build RF pipeline with preprocess]
    R --> S[Fit calibrated random forest]
    S --> T[Predict probabilities on test set]
    T --> U[Compute RF ROC AUC]

    U --> V[Plot ROC curve]
    U --> W[choose_cost_aware_threshold]
    W --> X[threshold_metrics across many thresholds]
    X --> Y[Select threshold minimizing FNR under max FPR]

    Y --> Z[Build confusion matrix at chosen threshold]
    Z --> AA[Plot confusion matrix]

    S --> AB[get_rf_feature_importances]
    AB --> AC[Extract feature names after preprocessing]
    AC --> AD[Plot top 20 feature importances]

    T --> AE[Compute AUC by sex subgroup]
    AE --> AF[Assemble metrics payload]
    AF --> AG[Write metrics.json]
    AG --> AH[Print summary metrics]